```

This indicates duplicate `dashboard` tabs are being produced/rendered.

The next implementation must inspect the current:

```text
src/components/builder/navigation/navigationtabsmanager.tsx
```

before making a replacement.

Do not hide the problem by switching React keys to array indexes.

The underlying BuilderDocument / navigation state should be corrected so
system navigation does not contain duplicate dashboard entries.

---

## Organization Validation Redundancy

The current validation requires:

```text
document.organization.companyName
```

even though the Builder is opened inside an already-authorized
Organization Admin context and the organization is already known.

The product direction established in this Waypoint is that organization
identity should not be duplicated merely for Builder validation.

Before changing the implementation, inspect the current Builder document
shape and validation implementation.

The desired direction is to avoid creating a second source of truth for
organization identity.

