# 13. Runtime Reference Experience

The Version 1 Mint experience remains a UX reference, not an architecture
to copy.

The reference experience demonstrates a member-oriented performance view
containing elements such as:

- member identity
- job role
- reporting context
- previous/current performance
- targets
- scores
- Objectives
- Key Results
- Initiatives
- tables / data presentation
- visualizations

The new platform should generate equivalent classes of experiences from
reusable data and configuration.

No Mint-specific person, tab, dashboard, or reporting structure should be
hardcoded.

